Id: print001w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_printers
References: cupsd.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST CM-7, SC-7; ISO 8.21; CE Secure configuration

CUPS browses the network for printers. It believes every
advertisement it hears, and print jobs go where the rogue printer
says. Turn Browsing off unless this host must find network
printers by itself.
